		}
		{
			dependencies: ["CFEAFAC25FD61F2C"]
			description: ["The Electric Blast Furnace takes over steel and alloy production from the Primitive Blast Furnace, which becomes obsolete as you move up the tiers. Check JEI's multiblock tab for its structure and requirements."]
